RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) module.

RAG module – Development roadmap
Feature	Purpose
1. Knowledge Dashboard	View total documents and knowledge chunks
2. Upload Documents	Upload PDF, DOCX and TXT files
3. Document Processing	Extract text, split into chunks and generate embeddings
4. Knowledge Listing	View uploaded documents and processing status
5. Document Search	Search knowledge using semantic similarity
6. AI Question & Answer	Ask questions using uploaded business knowledge
7. Source References	Show which documents support each answer
8. Delete Documents	Remove documents and associated embeddings

